---
import HomeTemplate from '../components/templates/HomeTemplate.astro';
---

<HomeTemplate
  title="SaveEditor.Online - Free .sav File Editor | Edit RPG Maker, Ren'Py Saves"
  description="Free save editor online. Edit .sav, .rpgsave, .save files in your browser. No download required. Works with RPG Maker, Ren'Py, Unity, and Unreal (.sav support is compatibility-first for standard GVAS)."
  keywords="save editor online, sav file editor, .sav file editor, save editor free, rpg maker save editor, renpy save editor, .rpgsave editor, game save editor, saveedit"
>
  <div slot="seo-content" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto prose prose-blue prose-lg text-gray-600 mb-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 text-center">
      The Ultimate Online Save File Editor
    </h2>
    <p>
      Welcome to <strong>SaveEditor.Online</strong>, the most advanced free online tool for editing
      game save files. Whether you want to adjust gold in an RPG Maker game, inspect
      gallery flags in a Ren'Py visual novel, or modify stats in a Unity game, our tool keeps the
      workflow backup-first and transparent.
    </p>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-8 not-prose">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Why Use a Web-Based Editor?</h3>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>No suspicious .exe downloads</li>
          <li>Works on Mac, Windows, Linux, Android</li>
          <li>Always up-to-date instantly</li>
          <li>Process files locally for privacy</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Supported Formats</h3>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
          <li><strong>RPG Maker</strong>: .rpgsave, .rmmzsave, .rvdata2, .rvdata, .rxdata, .lsd</li>
          <li><strong>Ren'Py</strong>: .save / persistent (limited stable write)</li>
          <li><strong>Unity</strong>: PlayerPrefs, .xml, .plist</li>
          <li><strong>Generic</strong>: .json, .ini, .sol, .sqlite, .msgpack, .cbor, .es3, .pkl</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p>
      Unlike editors that require unknown downloads or server-side parsing, <strong>SaveEditor.Online</strong>
      parses selected save files in your web browser. The selected save file is not uploaded to our parser
      server. We do use Google Analytics and AdSense for site performance and ads; see our Privacy and Cookie
      policies for details.
    </p>
  </div>
</HomeTemplate>
